{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Pool 3D (Poolians) is one of the best online pool games. It offers fast, realistic and satisfying game play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Play against the computer or real players all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Realistic controls, graphics and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Play 8-Ball, 15-Ball, Snooker and Coin Team games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Powerful in-game social features: avatars, profile pages, chats and friend list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5. Experience up to 60 hours of immersive 3D mode and permanently free 2D mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Supports 3 ball, 8 ball, 9 ball, 15 ball, Blackjack, 14+1, killer and snooker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Supports team play mode which allows maximum 6 players to play in one table at the same time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. More than 10 types of prized tournaments or events are held every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b4b3abc577539190711064876979d6469f708a01.jpg","localized_name":"Poolians Player","name":"Poolians Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670290/b4b3abc577539190711064876979d6469f708a01.jpg"},{"icon":"89af2a065f9b21a09e49510c4b3c9bf8f025dfa5.jpg","localized_name":"Advance","name":"Advance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670290/89af2a065f9b21a09e49510c4b3c9bf8f025dfa5.jpg"},{"icon":"259b364296e015eec30b03694fb497f02ecd05d7.jpg","localized_name":"Champion","name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670290/259b364296e015eec30b03694fb497f02ecd05d7.jpg"},{"icon":"5ad8f3c7f33904693648ac2a73aa5bbde2dc231c.jpg","localized_name":"Elite","name":"Elite","path":"https://cdn.